{"id":"87dbd27955ecb3b6","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-theory.md","title":"Theory","display":"df-theory — Theory","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-theory","aliases":["92-df-theory"],"display":"df-theory — Theory","depends_on":["[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-theory-closure]]"],"source":"本地理论与有限演算背景；原书第 III 章 pp.28–30 和第 V 章 pp.56–64 可作概念对照，以下闭包/演绎呈现不是原书逐字定义","source_status":"原书相关背景的本地理论定义或推论"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-theory — Theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"668e712bdadc015a\" href=\"?note=668e712bdadc015a\" title=\"92-df-theory-closure\">92-df-theory-closure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"本地理论与有限演算背景；原书第 III 章 pp.28–30 和第 V 章 pp.56–64 可作概念对照，以下闭包/演绎呈现不是原书逐字定义"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书相关背景的本地理论定义或推论"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentence-set parameter, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cn}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Cn}_G\\)</span> (logical-consequence closure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"668e712bdadc015a\" href=\"?note=668e712bdadc015a\" title=\"92-df-theory-closure\">92-df-theory-closure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Theory}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Theory}_G\\)</span> (definition-target predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}theory} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Theory}_G(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\nT\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\land\\mathrm{Cn}_G(T)=T\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}theory} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Theory}_G(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\nT\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\land\\mathrm{Cn}_G(T)=T\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>本文件把理论定义为对语义后承闭合的句子集；由一阶完备性才可等价地称为演绎封闭</li>\n<li>精确的闭合条件是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\models_G\\varphi\\Longrightarrow\\varphi\\in T\">\\(T\\models_G\\varphi\\Longrightarrow\\varphi\\in T\\)</span>；若使用从前提集出发的标准完备演算，才可改写为推导关系</li>\n<li>任意公理集<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>生成理论<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cn}_G(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cn}_G(A)\\)</span>，而任意理论<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>满足<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathrm{Cn}_G(T)\">\\(T=\\mathrm{Cn}_G(T)\\)</span></li>\n<li>PA的理论 = PA所有可证句子</li>\n<li>真算术TA是理论</li>\n<li>理论可一致或不一致</li>\n<li>理论可完备或不完备</li>\n<li>Gödel不完备性定理只对有效可公理化、相容且包含足够算术的理论推出不完备；较弱的递归理论（例如Presburger算术）可以完备</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory-closure","status":"resolved","id":"668e712bdadc015a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"",